    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934b3c49392036afa60b069a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经回满了。准备工作早已经做好了\\n——就在此刻，让我们……华丽地绽放吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce612a45785e91e21da6a30aeaa4865883ed8b692813100c740f92a112a19e85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead895d76fa007cf80bafdbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！\\n去证明吧！英里跑者的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f22f9a5825571a0290696d14a1df8e7e9d75e0f1a05a7a3d1d9a8b11fd3e99a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df330e7c7a0ea10e6a582171",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦。一起去传递爱吧！\\n向着全世界♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "137ff108681d397091b1d61e755bdb0a46b4de18fe1d1a20d04b086ff3b186c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6383fab5e1e7889a78e051",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了。那个，还有……\\n去创造新的历史吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2224f848d8bb90e66273a509f096da7ee668ad3928008dd7f27dcdde6875a4c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920d624883f155d4e17d3299",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经回满了。嘉德丽雅、月桂树——\n下一场比赛，您希望献上什么样的花束呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37b407b6ab047d9d20dba12306c18a6e823db265c60b96c1922b45fda238061",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6242ecc63dcd7335ff7f8535",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经满了。\\n去看看美丽的风景吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ae938d166ac2894093da99f5cbf09052e3ad65b7894eba0a82afdbab22c027",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c51e197d142ea1aab891b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已积满。\n让我们一同积累胜利，成为真正的圣女吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35039003364f9e8ee8889e3e74ee2cc32e4ce40b65f22b1431f08b9daff04b73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8931df7825ece10a7faa2c8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【最新话更新】RP攒满啦！\\n名为赛事的物语，让我们继续更新吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87728bda0aa2d3c4bd5889e759466186d1e8f404191684d77f59b217b185342e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a221464c486f90cb28aacb8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像回满了哦！\\n是时候让我们的命运，再次转动了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d648d3b87026555591ad8ae32ca077360c9c20bfb3bf4f67866ccac0616f964d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3b95473aaa01b110ce6cbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经全部恢复了。\\n我会边做伸展运动边等您的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80bc093358c6632979f15fb3288a5bfc5b9eb538c06b6b53fb1c89f2f3b49a69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af13e535407405161dd30f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以这充盈的RP为养分，让其绽放吧。\\n那永不凋零的――美丽的蔷薇王国。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3366becc738b6bd8e240bc75704ff4da6fa56849040c11ecbdd113bf1c700f2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0435e0b2b936b02bf8d37b8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已满……时机已到。\n来吧，是时候将战略付诸行动了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58078686fa8c6f60902a12e8c7eaed6ed21400f2d0ad35399623e2f890718b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2c5f1d6000275c9c902c24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP似乎已蓄满。\\n不必我多言……快些过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f252f078e2c2892d1c006f15fd039048909e382816c7a57994af7675825a29af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72bd5f216533e9fdff0182b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "提升支援卡等级\\n获取支援卡应援加成吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd17855cc9d794ef0c6c00a0b51815c48ecec6274c50c833a064d4a2b7ab8d61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3563dc5ef36a0a9197093a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过强化提升支援卡的等级\\n将会提高支援卡应援加成哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce4894e65d99c1b332b1929f346d1cba923f197c19dcccdbf89fae65695328e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997f9e3b3d69ce979c8b6c5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "支援卡应援加成有多少\\n团队竞技场的得分加成就有多少！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08f3ba20f9000946abc67f8e9520278ade98c38aaaa98a68cab4631e2a8b3456",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2c0ddd88ee6c7b039c168b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "提升支援卡应援加成吧！\\n团队竞技场中也可以获取支援点数！",
      "source_fingerprint": "683c6b18f67bb0aa47e17595f326dd22800843d92e44c5bd3917bbb5317abcf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ff4792ae11d1c092583fa19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "加成提高了呢！\\n照这样继续提升下去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b5f350c6a34665cd4af1239b4b2c74b65a8c07737669ac5205498d3da8f1f6c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:169a77152302c2ad15feb85e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的鼓舞之力越来越强了！\\n育成潜力也提升了，一石二鸟呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7202993e5afd7443421ce17f1ec212f2b05c5ca4c1d652d6f363b8201b567aa8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2382ec0ab496662a75bf3422",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真不错！\\n似乎能提高团队竞技场得分呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b1c7e0cbab79b4c7258b30e9878878f686220b6d279ed6133206bc657d6c6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3142f4c11dd8d06b729c076d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的鼓舞转化为巨大的力量！\\n团队竞技场得分也会变高呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe214ff617c8e6c095c5a03ffa80847ec0f8ed03c10fbc0b719b9c80042366e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "186",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38943032434de51be2ff0e0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "支援卡应援加成达到最大值了！\\n恭喜！",
